    {
      "text": "The cover of \"Monitoring and Evaluating Digital Health Interventions: A practical guide to conducting research and assessment,\" showing a close-up photograph of hands holding a tablet over paper forms on a desk, a row of four colored circles, and the logos of WHO, HRP (\"research for impact\"), the Johns Hopkins University Global mHealth Initiative and the United Nations Foundation. It illustrates the practical guide cited as reference (99) in the section on monitoring and evaluating progress on objectives.",
